          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 757,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.030:block:3",
          "start": 612
        },
        "quote": "(3) A brief description of the licensed activity, including the nature of the applicant’s business and the merchandise or services being offered.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.030:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.115.030 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "0ebfb3f7-9dac-556c-9bb4-87e321d53bd5",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 889,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.030:block:4",
          "start": 758
        },
        "quote": "(4) The location of any structure, building or conveyance to be used in the course of the licensed activity, including a site plan.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.030:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.115.030 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "67a25b0e-7dd3-55d2-bd80-2d51794d39e0",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1128,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.030:block:5",
          "start": 890
        },
        "quote": "(5) A statement indicating whether or not the applicant has had a transient vending license or a peddler’s or solicitor’s license revoked by the City or another municipality within the two preceding years prior to the date of application.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.030:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.115.030 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "58619c52-66b7-5669-8927-41c01798e036",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1617,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.030:block:6",
          "start": 1129
        },
        "quote": "(6) For peddlers and solicitors, a statement whether or not within 10 years immediately preceding the date of making application the applicant has been convicted of any felony or misdemeanor involving crimes against persons as those crimes are defined in K.S.A. Chapter 21 , Article 54 , and theft, burglary, and criminal use of a financial card as those crimes are defined in K.S.A. Chapter 21 , Article 58 . Criminal background reviews will be conducted by the Police Chief or designee.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.030:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.115.030 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "afac7cbb-5081-5303-af50-c6a69aefc82d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1777,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.030:block:7",
          "start": 1618
        },
        "quote": "(7) For transient vendors, written authorization from the owner or lessee of private property that the applicant may conduct activities at the identified site.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.030:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.115.030 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "174c7004-3a71-5e9a-8961-1a86f50702d4",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1943,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.030:block:8",
          "start": 1778
        },
        "quote": "(b) License Fees – Duration. The following license fees shall not be prorated or refundable for any reason, including denial of an application or license revocation:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.030:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.115.030 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "b7c8f1d7-d839-5c62-922e-9d31bd26553f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2306,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.030:block:9",
          "start": 1944
        },
        "quote": "(1) Transient Vendor. The per day fee shall be as prescribed by the City’s fee schedule. A transient vendor license shall be valid only for the day(s) set out in the license; except that the license is not valid during special events permitted pursuant to Chapter 12.70 TMC unless the participation of the licensee has been approved by the special event sponsor.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.030:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.115.030 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "361c0385-dfb6-5695-95b0-95b6dd241535",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2569,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.030:block:10",
          "start": 2307
        },
        "quote": "(2) Peddler or Solicitor. The annual fee shall be as prescribed by the City’s fee schedule, plus the cost of the criminal background review. A peddler or solicitor license shall expire on December 31st of the year in which it is issued. (Ord. 20662 § 5, 6-2-26.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.030:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
